    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) joined key national stakeholders at the 2nd National Mental Health Conference 2025, held in Nairobi under the theme \"Securing the Future: A Holistic Approach to Mental Health for Generations.\" The conference, officially opened by Health Cabinet Secretary Hon. Aden Duale, convened policymakers, mental health experts, researchers, and civil society organizations to chart a collective roadmap for advancing mental health in Kenya.",
